1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,975
The boutique will not

2
00:00:01,033 --> 00:00:02,032
sell you this watch.

3
00:00:02,415 --> 00:00:03,053
He will.

4
00:00:03,379 --> 00:00:04,017
He is not the

5
00:00:04,063 --> 00:00:05,515
manufacturer, and he is

6
00:00:05,596 --> 00:00:06,873
not an authorized dealer.

7
00:00:07,198 --> 00:00:08,011
He is a private

8
00:00:08,046 --> 00:00:09,102
dealer with a safe.

9
00:00:09,485 --> 00:00:10,077
He bought it at

10
00:00:10,112 --> 00:00:10,937
the list price.

11
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:12,295
The same price the

12
00:00:12,353 --> 00:00:13,537
boutique refused to take

13
00:00:13,572 --> 00:00:14,106
from you.

14
00:00:14,617 --> 00:00:15,870
This afternoon, he sells

15
00:00:15,917 --> 00:00:16,474
it to you for

16
00:00:16,544 --> 00:00:17,531
three times that.

17
00:00:17,856 --> 00:00:18,994
That premium is not

18
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,166
