29
00:00:33,854 --> 00:00:34,760
It collected the list

30
00:00:34,806 --> 00:00:36,420
price once, years ago,

31
00:00:36,745 --> 00:00:37,616
and moved on.

32
00:00:37,999 --> 00:00:38,800
So the waiting list

33
00:00:38,846 --> 00:00:39,682
